        "original_id": "d423219c-cb52-55b9-88c8-45a9c456211f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Mandrake, John Ostrander\n- Characters: Martian Manhunter, J'onn J'onzz\n- Companies: First Comics, DC Comics\n- Works: Grimjack, Firestorm, The Spectre, Martian Manhunter\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Mandrake was born on May 26, 1956, and he is an American comics artist.\n- Tom Mandrake is best known for collaborations with writer John Ostrander on several series.\n- Tom Mandrake and John Ostrander collaborated on Grimjack, which was published by First Comics.\n- Tom Mandrake and John Ostrander collaborated on Firestorm, The Spectre, and Martian Manhunter for DC Comics.\n- Martian Manhunter, also known as J'onn J'onzz, is a fictional superhero appearing in American comic books published by DC Comics.",
